title: PerformanceReview
---
<<declare $nameCorrect = false>>
<<declare $occupationCorrect = false>>
<<declare $loyaltyCorrect = false>>
<<declare $subjectScore = 0>>
<<declare $subjectMax = 0>>

<<declare $nameEmpty = false>>
<<declare $occupationEmpty = false>>
<<declare $loyaltyEmpty = false>>

<<declare $perfectForms = 0>>
<<declare $badForms = 0>>

<<get_total_score "YarnManager">>
<<play_sound_effect "YarnManager" "Buzzer">>
<<play_sound_effect "YarnManager" "Footsteps">>
<<show_portrait "YarnManager" "Miranda">>
Miranda strides into the room wearing a freshly-laundered suit. She taps her stylus an odd number of times and scribbles on a tablet.
<<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Empathy" 10>>
<<if $last_check_success>>
Empathy:[Em]Her presence is as suffocating as when she first interviewed you.[/Em]
<<endif>>
Miranda: Alright, your shift is up, Arbiter.
Miranda: Let's review today's performance.
-> Continue
    <<jump PerformanceReview_Mary>>
===

title: PerformanceReview_Mary
---
<<print_variable "$submittedFormsCount">>
<<get_subject_breakdown "YarnManager" "MaryGonzalez">>

Miranda: Subject: Mary Gonzalez.
<<if $nameEmpty>>
    Miranda: You didn't write her name down. 
    Miranda: Rookie mistake, Jonny.
<<endif>>
<<if $occupationEmpty>>
    Miranda: The occupation field is blank.
    Miranda: Tsk, tsk.
<<elseif not $occupationCorrect>>
    Miranda: What you wrote down doesn't exist in our system.
    Miranda: And really, who gives a damn about the ranks of gardeners?
<<endif>>
<<if $loyaltyEmpty>>
    Miranda: You left the loyalty rating completely unselected. 
    Miranda: We'll have to call her back for another assessment soon. That's always a headache. 
<<else>>
    Miranda: We trust your loyalty assessment.
<<endif>>
<<if $subjectScore >= $subjectMax>>
    <<set $perfectForms = $perfectForms + 1>>
    Miranda: Good work, Arbiter.
<<elseif $subjectScore > ($subjectMax / 2)>>
    Miranda: There are some errors on Ms. Gonzalez's form, but nothing major.
<<else>>
    <<set $badForms = $badForms + 1>>
    Miranda: This report is a failure, but one your betters won't hear of.
    Force: [Fo]She's covering your ass, even though she doesn't have to.[/Fo]
<<endif>>
-> Continue
    <<jump PerformanceReview_Eethin>>
===

title: PerformanceReview_Eethin
---
<<print_variable "$submittedFormsCount">>
<<get_subject_breakdown "YarnManager" "EethinMiller">>
Miranda: Subject: Eethin Roosevelt Miller. 
<<if $nameEmpty>>
    Miranda: You skipped his name. We have a clear mandate to record their identities.
<<elseif not $nameCorrect>>
    Miranda: You filled out his name wrong, in part because you interrupted his spelling.
    Miranda: You should know how common a spelling 'EE-thin' is. 
<<endif>>
<<if $occupationEmpty>>
    Miranda: The occupation field for Miller is completely blank.
<<elseif not $occupationCorrect>>
    Miranda: His position within the Republic's compliance structure was incorrectly recorded.
    Miranda: Given his evasive answer, we can forgive this. 
<<endif>>
<<if $loyaltyEmpty>>
    Miranda: No loyalty assessment provided for this subject.
<<elseif not $loyaltyCorrect>>
    Miranda: You underestimated his loyalty. The Republic should seek to uplift devoted youths like him. 
    Miranda: Unless you were... intimidated by his enthusiasm?
<<endif>>
<<if $subjectScore == $subjectMax>>
    <<set $perfectForms = $perfectForms + 1>>
    <<if $perfectForms >= 2>>
        Miranda: Once again, flawless work. Well done, Jonny!
        <<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Insight" 13>>
        <<if $last_check_success>>
            Insight: [In]Praise to intellect! Sweet, sweet praise![/In]
        <<endif>>
    <<else>>
    Miranda: This form is flawless. Well done.
    <<endif>>
<<elseif $subjectScore > ($subjectMax / 2)>>
    Miranda: As far as forms go, this'll do just fine. 
<<else>>
    <<set $badForms = $badForms + 1>>
    Miranda: A complete failure in judgment. This one should have been easy.
    <<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Force" 10>>
    <<if $last_check_success>>
    Force: [Fo]Damn.[/Fo]
    <<endif>>
    <<if $badForms >= 2>>
        Miranda: ...
        Empathy: [Em]I don't think she's happy with us.[/Em]
    <<endif>>
<<endif>>
-> Continue
    <<jump PerformanceReview_William>>
===

title: PerformanceReview_William
---
<<print_variable "$submittedFormsCount">>
<<get_subject_breakdown "YarnManager" "WilliamGote">>
Miranda: Subject: William Gote. Let's see...
<<if $nameEmpty>>
    Miranda: You neglected to write his name.
<<elseif not $nameCorrect>>
    Miranda: 'Billy' is nobody's full legal name.
    Miranda: Even a junior arbiter like Eethin knows mononyms are illegal.
    Insight: [In]We definitely have that in our notes somewhere.[/In]
<<endif>>
<<if $occupationEmpty>>
    Miranda: You left the occupation line empty. I never understand how that can happen.
<<endif>>
<<if $loyaltyEmpty>>
    Miranda: Am I seeing this right? You never put down his loyalty?
    Miranda: This is particularly egregious, considering the subject.
<<elseif not $loyaltyCorrect>>
    Miranda: Normally, I'd say that I trust your judgement of people's loyalty to the Republic.
    Miranda: But I have trouble doing so given William's... demeanor. 
<<endif>>
<<if $subjectScore == $subjectMax>>
    <<set $perfectForms = $perfectForms + 1>>
    Miranda: This form looks excellent, top to bottom.
    <<if $perfectForms >= 3>>
        Miranda: That makes three flawless assessments.
        Miranda: Your perception is not to be underestimated, Jonathan.
        Force: [Fo]Fuck yeah! Doesn't that just feel amazing?[/Fo]
        Empathy: [Em]Sure it does...[/Em]
    <<endif>>
<<elseif $subjectScore > ($subjectMax / 2)>>
    Miranda: Despite the mistakes, we can still work with this form.
<<else>>
    <<set $badForms = $badForms + 1>>
    Miranda: A complete failure in judgment. 
    <<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Force" 10>>
    <<if $last_check_success>>
    Force: [Fo]Damn.[/Fo]
    <<endif>>
    <<if $badForms >= 3>>
        Miranda: Never have I seen such terrible performance from you or any other Arbiter.
        Miranda: You realize this reflects poorly on me, don't you? We can manage these issues discreetly for now, but if you don't shape up soon...
        Miranda: [Fo]The Republic[/Fo] will take notice.
    <<endif>>
<<endif>>
-> (Final Evaluation)
    <<jump PerformanceReview_Final>>
===

title: PerformanceReview_Final
---
<<get_total_score "YarnManager">>
<<if $totalScore >= $maxScore * 0.85>>
    Miranda: I rarely say this, but I'm impressed, Jonny
    Miranda: Continue in this manner, and the Republic will reward you greatly for your service.
    <<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Force" 12>>
    <<if $last_check_success>>
        Force: [Fo]Boosh.[/Fo]
    <<endif>>
<<elseif $totalScore >= $maxScore * 0.5>>
    Miranda: Your performance was... adequate. 
    Miranda: We expect improvement.
<<else>>
    Miranda: Your performance was lacking. You'd better shape up soon.
    Miranda: There are many 'Eethins' out there jumping to take your place.
    <<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Force" 12>>
    <<if $last_check_success>>
        Force: [Fo]If I were more than just a fragment of your psyche and had a physical form, I'd be shitting my physical pants.[/Fo]
    <<endif>>
<<endif>>
Miranda: That will be all for today. We'll see you tomorrow.
-> (End Day)
    //<<jump PerformanceReview_VISO_Check>>
<<end_day "YarnManager" "END">>
===

title: PerformanceReview_VISO_Check
---
<<if $is_rebel>>
    <<jump VISO_Rebel>>
<<else>>
    <<jump VISO_Conformist>>
<<endif>>
===

title: VISO_Conformist
---
<<play_sound "YarnManager" "VISO">>
The Voice of Someone Important: [Fo]There he is. My star Arbiter.[/Fo]

The Voice of Someone Important: [Fo]Did you feel that? The rhythm of it all? The order?[/Fo]
The Voice of Someone Important: [Fo]Forms filled. Subjects processed. Truth distilled into something... usable.[/Fo]

The Voice of Someone Important: [Fo]That's what separates you from them.[/Fo]
The Voice of Someone Important: [Fo]They live messy, confused little lives.[/Fo]
The Voice of Someone Important: [Fo]You make sense of them.[/Fo]

<<SkillCheck "YarnManager" "Empathy" 10>>
<<if $last_check_success>>
Empathy: [Em]Warmth. Approval. It settles into you like a blanket.[/Em]
<<endif>>

The Voice of Someone Important: [Fo]Keep going like this, and there’s no limit to what you can become.[/Fo]
The Voice of Someone Important: [Fo]We’ll make something great together.[/Fo]

<<end_day "YarnManager" "END">>
===